      "title": "Character Creator - flow",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Edit the instruction and concept, then run: Qwen3.5 writes a Character Card V2 JSON.\n2. Load Portrait supplies the avatar; swap in a generator for new art.\n3. The baker saves the card PNG into input/characters, so it appears in Character Chat's character list (press the refresh button on the chat panel) and in any other chat workflow.\n4. Character Chat reads that card straight away (card_path); set action/user_message to keep talking.\n5. Saving: the card is saved by the baker every run. Use Save chat on the chat panel to write the conversation to output/chats (.txt and .json). The chat is also kept inside this workflow, so save the workflow itself (Ctrl+S) to resume later.\n6. Group 3b bakes the same card into a character .safetensors in models/refmods. Character Chat lists it as refmod:<name> after a refresh. Bypass the node if you only want the PNG."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
